#   @x402-foundation/concordium  — Concordium network maintainers
#   @x402-foundation/hedera      — Hedera network maintainers
#   @x402-foundation/keeta       — Keeta network maintainers
#   @x402-foundation/near        — NEAR network maintainers
#   @x402-foundation/tvm         — TVM (TON) network maintainers
